    monet-quick reset on|off             reset at the next restart, or don't (asks for an administrator's password)
    monet-quick firmware-check           firmware updates for this PC's own parts (fwupd), as JSON
    monet-quick firmware-update          install them
    monet-quick restart                  ask to restart, the way the app menu does
    monet-quick widgets                  open the widget gallery, as the desktop's Add Widgets does
    monet-quick music                    the apps that play music (the default first) and the Store, as JSON
    monet-quick launch ID                start an app by its menu entry's file name (as hex of its UTF-8)
    monet-quick frames                   put the apps Monet hasn't painted on its canvas, so every app fits in
    monet-quick zen                      dress Zen in Monet's look (its window, and new tabs on the painting)
    monet-quick kde PAGE                 open a page of KDE's System Settings
    monet-quick open [PAGE]              open Monet Settings (at light, wifi, bluetooth, printers,
                                         display, sound, datetime, users, input, power, privacy,
                                         notifications, accessibility, apps, storage, games,
